 unity among its inhabitants.</li><li>Meet colorful characters and help them solve troubles big and small.</li><li>Explore ancient caverns, enchanting forests and busy settlements.</li><li>Discover the secrets of the land and the magic within.</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-48 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-747fd990 fc-game-animation-col\" data-id=\"747fd990\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-212d3086 fc-game-animation elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"212d3086\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\" src=\"@root/Compartido/Images/Sincronizado/fc-home-a-winding-path-hover-f86697a27d6fb7.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-4973\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42414c77 fc-game-animation-toggle elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"42414c77\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"#pause-animation\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Pause animation\" aria-pressed=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fas fa-pause\"></i>\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Pause